computing hit probability. Since you are what you eat, perhaps
a new monster type is in order: the Gymnast. The Gymnast would
natrually get about a bazillion attacks per round, but each
attack would do only moderate damage. Eating a Gymnast corpse
would both decrease your luck (for eating a human) and have a
small give chance of increasing your dexterity. The Gymnasts could be
nmed, like the Quantum Mechanics are now. What do you think?


